<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p>Dear Learner,</p>

<p>This is to inform you that the Hall Ticket for the upcoming Online Examination has been released and is now available on the Student Portal.</p>

<p>Steps to download your Hall Ticket:</p>

<ol>
	<li>Log in to the Student Portal using your registered credentials.</li>
	<li>Navigate to Examinations → Hall Ticket.</li>
	<li>Download and save a copy for your reference.</li>
</ol>

<p>Students are advised to verify all details mentioned on the Hall Ticket, including name, programme, course code, and examination schedule. In case of any discrepancy, please report the same immediately to the Examination Cell through the helpdesk.</p>

<p>Important Instructions:</p>

<p>Ensure your system and internet connectivity meet the prescribed requirements for online examinations.</p>

<p>For any technical assistance, please contact the Helpdesk.</p>

<ul>
	<li>We wish you the very best for your examinations.</li>
</ul>
</body>
</html>